flowchart TD
  S[URL / WeChat / file / RSS] --> C[Capture + normalize URL]
  C --> D{Duplicate?}
  D -- yes --> R[Reuse an existing item]
  D -- no --> N[Create source and item records]
  R --> H[Health / freshness / recoverable batch state]
  N --> H
  H -->|available| T[Scoped retrieval + report generation]
  H -->|failed| RETRY[Visible retry / replace source]
  RETRY --> C
  T --> V[Report citations / gaps / topic versions]
  V --> CL[Claim / evidence relations + version comparison]
  CL --> A[Architecture readiness + candidate deliverable]
  A --> AR[Review records / HOLD / acceptance]
  AR -->|return or missing evidence| B[Revise source / context / artifact]
  B --> T
  A --> X[Supported WorkTask export or callback]
  X --> REC[Artifact revision / hash / receipt / audit handoff]
  AR --> REC
  LIMIT[Review records do not impose a universal gate on existing export or CLI paths]
  X -. boundary .-> LIMIT
